### **3.13. UC-13: Reply to Topic**

| Field                  | Description                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                               |
| :--------------------- | :------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------ |
| **Use Case ID:**       | UC-13                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                     |
| **Use Case Name:**     | Reply to Topic                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                            |
| **Brief Description:** | The actor adds a comment or response to an existing forum discussion.                                                                                                                                                                                                     |
| **Actor:**             | Authenticated User                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                        |
| **Pre-conditions:**    | The user is logged in and viewing a specific forum topic thread.                                                                                                                                                                                                          |
| **Post-conditions:**   | The reply is appended to the discussion thread and stored in the database.                                                                                                                                                                                                |
| **Main Success Flow:** | 1. The actor views an existing topic thread.<br>2. The actor enters text into the reply input field.<br>3. The actor clicks "Post Reply".<br>4. The system validates the text content.<br>5. The system saves the reply and updates the UI for all viewers of that topic. |
| **Alternative Flows:** | None                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                      |
| **Exception Flows:**   | **E1: Empty Reply**: If the input field is empty, the system disables the "Post" button or shows a warning.                                                                                                                                                              |

