### **3.14. UC-14: Search Digital Library**

| Field                  | Description                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                              |
| :--------------------- | :--------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- |
| **Use Case ID:**       | UC-14                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                    |
| **Use Case Name:**     | Search Digital Library                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                   |
| **Brief Description:** | The actor searches for and accesses shared documents or media files within the room's library.                                                                                                                                                                                                                                           |
| **Actor:**             | Authenticated User                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                       |
| **Pre-conditions:**    | The user is inside a virtual room and interacts with the Library system.                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                 |
| **Post-conditions:**   | The user finds and retrieves the desired resource.                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                       |
| **Main Success Flow:** | 1. The actor opens the library interface.<br>2. The system displays a list of available resources.<br>3. The actor enters keywords into the search bar.<br>4. The system filters the list in real-time.<br>5. The actor clicks "View" or "Download" on a resource.<br>6. The system opens the resource.                                  |
| **Alternative Flows:** | **A1: Uploading a Resource**<br>1. In step 2, the actor clicks "Upload Resource".<br>2. The actor selects a file and clicks "Upload".<br>3. The system validates the file size and saves it.                                                                                                                                             |
| **Exception Flows:**   | **E1: Resource Not Found**: If no matches are found, the system displays "No resources found."                                                                                                                                                                                                                                           |

