| **Post-conditions:**   | The character sprite updates visually for all participants.                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                        |
| **Main Success Flow:** | 1. The actor presses the 'Q' key.<br>2. The system toggles the "isUsingPhone" state.<br>3. The system updates the character's animation to a phone-holding frame.<br>4. The system broadcasts the state change via WebSocket.<br>5. Other participants see the actor's avatar holding a phone.                                                     |
