### **3.17. UC-17: Fullscreen Overlays**

| Field                  | Description                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                            |
| :--------------------- | :--------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- |
| **Use Case ID:**       | UC-17                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                  |
| **Use Case Name:**     | Fullscreen Overlays                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                    |
| **Brief Description:** | The actor switches to an immersive view for tools like the Calendar or Forum.                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                          |
| **Actor:**             | Authenticated User                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                     |
| **Pre-conditions:**    | The user is logged in and accessing room features.                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                     |
| **Post-conditions:**   | The UI transitions to a centered fullscreen overlay.                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                   |
| **Main Success Flow:** | 1. The actor selects the "Expand" icon on a feature panel.<br>2. The system applies a glassmorphic blur to the background canvas.<br>3. The system renders the component as a high-resolution overlay.<br>4. The actor interacts with the feature.<br>5. The actor clicks "Close".<br>6. The system restores the standard room view.                                  |
| **Alternative Flows:** | None                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                   |
| **Exception Flows:**   | None                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                   |

Table 21: Use case Description - Fullscreen Overlays

### **3.18. UC-18: Collaborative Whiteboard**

| Field                  | Description                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                     |
| :--------------------- | :---------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- |
| **Use Case ID:**       | UC-18                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                           |
| **Use Case Name:**     | Collaborative Whiteboard                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                        |
| **Brief Description:** | The actor uses a shared drawing board to brainstorm in real-time.                                                                                                                                                                                                                               |
| **Actor:**             | Authenticated User                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                              |
