| **Post-conditions:**   | Drawing data is synchronized and persisted.                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                     |
| **Main Success Flow:** | 1. The actor approaches a whiteboard and presses 'E'.<br>2. The system opens Excalidraw.<br>3. The actor draws elements.<br>4. The system broadcasts changes via WebSockets.<br>5. Other participants see the updates instantly.                                                                |
