### **3.19. UC-19: Admin Management**

| Field                  | Description                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                    |
| :--------------------- | :--------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- |
| **Use Case ID:**       | UC-19                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                          |
| **Use Case Name:**     | Admin Management                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                               |
| **Brief Description:** | An administrator manages the platform's resources (users, rooms, forum).                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                       |
| **Actor:**             | Admin                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                          |
| **Pre-conditions:**    | The user is logged in with admin privileges.                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                   |
| **Post-conditions:**   | Targeted resources are modified or deleted.                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                    |
| **Main Success Flow:** | 1. The actor navigates to `/admin`.<br>2. The system verifies credentials and shows the dashboard.<br>3. The actor selects a category (e.g., "Users").<br>4. The system displays a searchable list.<br>5. The actor performs an action (e.g., banning a user).<br>6. The system executes the command and updates the database.                                                                  |
| **Alternative Flows:** | None                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                           |
| **Exception Flows:**   | **E1: Unauthorized Access**: If the user is not an admin, access is denied.                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                    |

