| **Main Success Flow:** | 1. The actor clicks the "Mini-map" icon.<br>2. The system generates a scaled map view.<br>3. The system shows icons for all participants.<br>4. The system updates positions in real-time.<br>5. The actor clicks the icon again to close.                                                                                                  |
