### **3.21. UC-21: Periodic State Snapshots**

| Field                  | Description                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                              |
| :--------------------- | :--------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- |
| **Use Case ID:**       | UC-21                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                    |
| **Use Case Name:**     | Periodic State Snapshots                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                 |
| **Brief Description:** | The system automatically saves room states and whiteboard data every 30 seconds.                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                         |
| **Actor:**             | System (Automated)                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                       |
| **Pre-conditions:**    | The server is running and active sessions exist.                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                         |
| **Post-conditions:**   | Data is persisted to MongoDB.                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                            |
| **Main Success Flow:** | 1. The system runs a background loop every 30 seconds.<br>2. The system identifies "dirty" (modified) states.<br>3. The system serializes the data.<br>4. The system saves snapshots to the database.<br>5. The system clears the "dirty" flags.                                                                                         |
| **Alternative Flows:** | None                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                     |
| **Exception Flows:**   | **E1: Persistence Failure**: If the database write fails, the system logs an error.                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                      |

Table 25: Use case Description - System Persistence

### **3.22. UC-22: API Rate Limiting**

| Field                  | Description                                                                                                                                                                                                                                  |
| :--------------------- | :------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- |
| **Use Case ID:**       | UC-22                                                                                                                                                                                                                                        |
| **Use Case Name:**     | API Rate Limiting                                                                                                                                                                                                                            |
| **Brief Description:** | The system restricts the number of requests a user can make within a timeframe to prevent abuse.                                                                                                                                             |
| **Actor:**             | System (Automated)                                                                                                                                                                                                                           |
| **Pre-conditions:**    | Incoming HTTP or WebSocket requests.                                                                                                                                                                                                         |
| **Post-conditions:**   | Malicious or excessive traffic is blocked.                                                                                                                                                                                                   |
| **Main Success Flow:** | 1. The system receives a request.<br>2. The system checks the IP's request count.<br>3. If below the threshold, the request proceeds.<br>4. If above, the system returns a 429 "Too Many Requests" error.<br>5. The system logs the incident. |
| **Alternative Flows:** | None                                                                                                                                                                                                                                         |
| **Exception Flows:**   | None                                                                                                                                                                                                                                         |

Table 26: Use case Description - Rate Limiting

### **3.23. UC-23: Spatial Chat Filtering**

| Field                  | Description                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                  |
| :--------------------- | :----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- |
| **Use Case ID:**       | UC-23                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                        |
| **Use Case Name:**     | Spatial Chat Filtering                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                       |
| **Brief Description:** | The system limits chat visibility to nearby participants.                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                    |
| **Actor:**             | Authenticated User                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                           |
| **Pre-conditions:**    | The user sends a message in a room.                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                          |
| **Post-conditions:**   | Only players within range receive the message.                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                               |
| **Main Success Flow:** | 1. The actor sends a chat message.<br>2. The system calculates distances to all other participants.<br>3. The system filters distribution to a 250px radius.<br>4. The system displays a chat bubble above the actor's avatar.<br>5. Nearby players see the message in their logs.                                                                                                                            |
| **Alternative Flows:** | None                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                         |
| **Exception Flows:**   | None                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                         |

Table 27: Use case Description - Spatial Chat

### **3.24. UC-24: Directional Seat Snapping**

| Field                  | Description                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                |
| :--------------------- | :------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- |
| **Use Case ID:**       | UC-24                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                      |
| **Use Case Name:**     | Directional Seat Snapping                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                  |
| **Brief Description:** | The system snaps the character to a seat and aligns their orientation.                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                     |
| **Actor:**             | Authenticated User                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                         |
| **Pre-conditions:**    | Character is near a chair object.                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                          |
| **Post-conditions:**   | Character is positioned and oriented correctly on the seat.                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                |
| **Main Success Flow:** | 1. The actor moves near a chair.<br>2. The actor presses 'E'.<br>3. The system identifies the chair's target coordinates and orientation.<br>4. The system updates character position.<br>5. The system sets "Sitting" state and faces the character correctly.<br>6. The system broadcasts the update.                                                                                                                                                                    |
| **Alternative Flows:** | None                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                       |
| **Exception Flows:**   | **E1: Seat Occupied**: If another user is sitting, interaction is denied.                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                  |

