| **Post-conditions:**   | UI elements are rendered with glassmorphism styles.                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                       |
| **Main Success Flow:** | 1. The user navigates the platform.<br>2. The system applies CSS backdrop-filter blur and semi-transparent backgrounds.<br>3. The system ensures high text contrast.<br>4. The user interacts with smooth transitions.                                                                                                                                                    |
| **Alternative Flows:** | None                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                      |
