### **3.26. UC-26: Web Audio Spatial Engine**

| Field                  | Description                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                         |
| :--------------------- | :---------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- |
| **Use Case ID:**       | UC-26                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                               |
| **Use Case Name:**     | Web Audio Spatial Engine                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                            |
| **Brief Description:** | The system adjusts volume and stereo panning based on avatar positions.                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                             |
| **Actor:**             | Authenticated User                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                  |
| **Pre-conditions:**    | User is in an active proximity call.                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                |
| **Post-conditions:**   | Audio reflects the spatial geometry of the room.                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                    |
| **Main Success Flow:** | 1. The actor moves around a speaker.<br>2. The system calculates distance and angle.<br>3. The system applies volume roll-off via GainNode.<br>4. The system applies stereo panning via PannerNode.<br>5. The system adjusts video overlay opacity based on distance.                                                                                                                                                                                                                             |
| **Alternative Flows:** | None                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                |
| **Exception Flows:**   | **E1: Audio Engine Failure**: Fallback to mono audio.                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                               |

Table 30: Use case Description - Spatial Media Engine
